      "howto": "Added as the package recharts. Wrap every chart in <ResponsiveContainer width=\"100%\" height={300}> inside a parent that has a set height. Typical use: import { LineChart, Line, XAxis, YAxis, Tooltip, CartesianGrid, ResponsiveContainer } from 'recharts'; <LineChart data={rows}><CartesianGrid strokeDasharray=\"3 3\" /><XAxis dataKey=\"week\" /><YAxis /><Tooltip /><Line type=\"monotone\" dataKey=\"score\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" /></LineChart>. Data is an array of plain objects. For bars use BarChart and Bar. Give the chart a one-sentence text summary next to it. Read the charts-dashboard skill for choosing and laying out charts.",
